  "lessons": [
    "<strong>Allah's promise outruns Pharaoh's decree.</strong> The child marked for death was raised in the murderer's own palace, fed by his own mother, at the murderer's expense. What Allah plans, no throne can intercept.",
    "<strong>One act of service at a well rebuilt a life.</strong> A wanted fugitive watered two women's sheep, prayed one desperate sentence, and received safety, work, family and prophethood. Kindness done for Allah is never unpaid.",
    "<strong>The magicians knew when a trick ends and truth begins.</strong> The experts who tried to fake the miracle recognised the real one instantly and chose death over their paymaster. Knowledge obliges honesty.",
    "<strong>Pharaoh believed at the bottom of the sea.</strong> Faith found in the last breath, after a lifetime of cruelty, was worthless. The time to submit is while you can still choose it.",
    "<strong>Freedom wasted becomes wandering.</strong> The generation that crossed the sea was spared the work of entering the land. Miracles do not replace courage, and Musa's patience outlasted forty years of grumbling."
  ],
